Okay Hank, we start off with Shakespeare,

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:55.360
poetry, reference, reference, reference,

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.900
then we got Islam,

00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:00.200
we got a wicker basket, then we got Christianity.

