And then we've got some history and social sciences,

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:10.720
author copies of An Abundance of Katherines, author copies of Looking For Alaska,

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:13.940
foreign editions of both books and children's books.

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:16.440
Then in the main room, we have first editions of contemporary fiction,

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.560
literary biography,

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:18.380
southern studies

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:20.720
then up here we got novels by dead guys...

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.380
stuff Mark Twain wrote,

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:23.140
and travel.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.340
Then we have novels by living authors,

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:26.860
